 .../Semantics/Plan/ScanHistory/Plan.lean      |  97 +++++++++++++
 .../Semantics/Plan/ScanHistory/Schedule.lean  | 130 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 227 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 leanncd/LeanNCD/Semantics/Plan/ScanHistory/Plan.lean
